Package: canstreet
Type: Package
Title: Download and Harmonize Historical Statistics Canada Road Network Files
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Jens", "von Bergmann", email = "jens@mountainmath.ca",
           role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = "creator and maintainer"),
    person("Tim", "Gensey", email = "genseytim@gmail.com", role = "aut"))
Description: Downloads, caches and harmonizes the historical Statistics Canada
    road and street network files so that the evolution of the Canadian road
    network can be analysed reproducibly. The files span three distinct
    attribute schemas and three coordinate reference systems across their
    history; this package normalizes them into a single spatially indexed
    'DuckDB' store that can be queried across vintages, and matches segments
    between vintages to build a temporally unified network in which each
    segment is tagged with the years it is present in. Data come from the
    Road Network File <https://www150.statcan.gc.ca/n1/en/catalogue/92-500-X>
    and its Street Network File predecessors, distributed under the Statistics
    Canada Open Licence
    <https://www.statcan.gc.ca/en/reference/licence>.
